  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the decomposition of azomethane. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;a first order reaction, the variation in partial pressure with time at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is given as</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7fc9241b-0f61-4342-9d09-778ad1b8816a-image.png\" style=\"width: 268px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>The half life of the reaction is____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For first order reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>-</mo><mi>kt</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p>Slope=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>465</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>465</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>For a first order reaction,Half-life is related to rate constant as given below</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>465</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>seconds</p></blockquote>",
